       >>SOURCE FORMAT FREE
IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. EXBAD.
DATA DIVISION.
LINKAGE SECTION.
01 SOURCE-AMOUNT PIC 9(5)V99.
01 RESULT-AMOUNT PIC 9(5)V99.
01 RESULT-STATUS PIC 99.
PROCEDURE DIVISION USING SOURCE-AMOUNT RESULT-AMOUNT RESULT-STATUS.
UNSAFE-OVERWRITE.
    MOVE ZERO TO RESULT-AMOUNT RESULT-STATUS.
    COMPUTE RESULT-AMOUNT = SOURCE-AMOUNT * 2
        ON SIZE ERROR
            MOVE 24 TO RESULT-STATUS
            MOVE ZERO TO RESULT-AMOUNT
        NOT ON SIZE ERROR
            MOVE ZERO TO RESULT-STATUS
    END-COMPUTE.
    MOVE 7 TO RESULT-AMOUNT.
    GOBACK.
